# fixture editor_house: a SCRATCH copy of the editor's game folder for daemon / verb cases (decision D2: 3 cases had copied these rows by hand). $T = the scratch dir. Pets: ember at (5,5) in 'store', Harold (trainer) at (7,7), board shows the editor's own book on desk 'store'. Use: INCLUDE | ../fixtures/editor_house.pdl
CASE    | setup
SCRATCH |
MKDIR | house/&.widgits
MKDIR | house/#.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img
MKDIR | house/@.apps/rpg-edit-hq/ops/+x
